278
00:21:15,774 --> 00:21:17,860
Sure. Thanks, Alex. Thank you.

279
00:21:53,940 --> 00:21:55,191
Here’s your drink.

280
00:21:58,945 --> 00:22:02,323
Are you doing anything later?

281
00:22:03,241 --> 00:22:06,661
