Because if not, then you're just
extending your pain to them.

329
00:25:28,112 --> 00:25:33,868
The truth is, I tell them right
from the start that I don’t commit.

330
00:25:35,244 --> 00:25:38,623
We date, we fuck, and then
we get tired of each other.

331
00:25:39,624 --> 00:25:42,377
