Via said she’s busy.

447
00:32:33,412 --> 00:32:34,580
Really?

448
00:32:34,605 --> 00:32:36,899
Okay, agreed, then I'll go home with you.
Let's go together.

449
00:32:36,924 --> 00:32:38,551
But I’ll be going to the coffee shop.

450
00:32:40,753 --> 00:32:42,463
Fine… Okay, be careful.

451
00:32:43,506 --> 00:32:44,632
