for the rest of your life, Shan.

479
00:34:08,424 --> 00:34:09,758
And successful.

480
00:34:10,426 --> 00:34:12,133
And I don’t think
there’s anything wrong with that.

481
00:34:12,158 --> 00:34:12,700
Right?

482
00:34:13,095 --> 00:34:13,637
Yup.

483
00:34:13,637 --> 00:34:15,014
Of course. Yes.

484
00:34:15,181 --> 00:34:16,390
You do you, Shan.

485
00:34:17,099 --> 00:34:18,309
Okay, I’m gonna go.

486
00:34:18,893 --> 00:34:19,685
Okay, take care.

487
00:34:19,685 --> 00:34:20,811
