522
00:36:24,549 --> 00:36:26,760
Master told me you're really smart.

523
00:36:26,916 --> 00:36:29,335
That's why I know you
can handle architecture.

524
00:36:31,066 --> 00:36:32,776
It's just exhausting.

525
00:36:34,028 --> 00:36:35,320
It is exhausting.

526
00:36:37,072 --> 00:36:39,033
But you'll keep fighting, right?

527
00:36:43,454 --> 00:36:45,835
