Yanna.

541
00:39:24,486 --> 00:39:26,071
Right? You guys are happy?

542
00:39:26,096 --> 00:39:28,056
So happy. How happy?

543
00:39:28,081 --> 00:39:31,126
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

544
00:39:35,461 --> 00:39:38,648
Hey, take it easy there.

545
00:39:38,907 --> 00:39:40,534
Just let me be. I'm happy.

546
00:39:40,559 --> 00:39:42,269
How happy?

547
00:39:42,611 --> 00:39:44,749
- How much?
- So happy because—

548
00:39:45,093 --> 00:39:47,012
- Because?
- Because I can go out now.

549
00:39:47,012 --> 00:39:47,971
Okay.

550
00:39:47,971 --> 00:39:51,350
I'm still scared, but it's less now!

551
00:39:51,350 --> 00:39:56,772
Less? Is that all, or is it because you're
seeing someone at the coffee shop?

552
00:39:56,772 --> 00:39:57,231
Huh?

553
00:39:57,231 --> 00:39:57,606
Huh?

554
00:40:01,380 --> 00:40:03,424
I’m not, I’m not.

555
00:40:03,487 --> 00:40:04,863
There’s no one.

556
00:40:04,863 --> 00:40:06,114
Hey!

557
00:40:06,657 --> 00:40:08,992
Ke, we're not here to get wasted.

558
00:40:09,326 --> 00:40:10,619
We still have class tomorrow.

559
00:40:11,954 --> 00:40:13,080
I'm going out first.

560
00:40:14,039 --> 00:40:15,040
- Okay?
- Yeah, okay, okay.

561
00:40:15,040 --> 00:40:16,542
I’ll just get some fresh air, guys.

562
00:40:16,880 --> 00:40:20,312
I'm just gonna walk a bit.
I ate so much.

563
00:40:20,337 --> 00:40:21,713
Text me, okay?

564
00:40:21,969 --> 00:40:24,066
- I'll just be outside.
- I know.

565
00:40:24,091 --> 00:40:25,425
I won't go far.

566
00:40:25,425 --> 00:40:26,635
You take care, text me.

567
00:40:26,635 --> 00:40:28,095
Yeah, I'll just be outside.

568
00:40:28,262 --> 00:40:29,221
Cheers.

569
00:40:29,221 --> 00:40:31,014
Hey! Luna, how are you?

570
00:40:31,348 --> 00:40:32,724
I'm fine. You want to sit here first?

571
00:40:32,724 --> 00:40:33,767
Didn’t know you were here.

572
00:40:33,767 --> 00:40:35,102
Want some nachos?

573
00:40:48,597 --> 00:40:49,473
You’re drunk?

574
00:40:50,617 --> 00:40:51,910
You're here again.

575
00:40:52,536 --> 00:40:54,538
You're probably following me.

576
00:40:56,039 --> 00:40:58,000
I wonder why we keep
running into each other.

577
00:40:58,166 --> 00:40:59,167
What do you think?

578
00:40:59,751 --> 00:41:00,627
Destiny?

579
00:41:02,337 --> 00:41:04,047
You believe in that?

580
00:41:04,848 --> 00:41:06,766
That doesn't fit your brand.

581
00:41:26,881 --> 00:41:27,943
Are you okay?

582
00:41:39,003 --> 00:41:40,797
Why are you suddenly crying?

583
00:41:42,552 --> 00:41:44,971
It's dirty there. Get up from there.

584
00:41:45,088 --> 00:41:47,966
It hurts. My head hurts.

585
00:41:52,304 --> 00:41:53,347
Here.

586
00:41:53,555 --> 00:41:54,723
Drink some.

587
00:41:58,769 --> 00:41:59,978
More.

588
00:42:04,191 --> 00:42:06,991
How do you know my name?

589
00:42:10,947 --> 00:42:12,240
From your I.D.

590
00:42:12,449 --> 00:42:12,824
What?

591
00:42:12,824 --> 00:42:14,326
It's attached to your bag.

592
00:42:14,868 --> 00:42:17,329
Kierra Zylene V. Ynares.

593
00:42:17,621 --> 00:42:20,540
So why did you follow me on IG?

594
00:42:22,125 --> 00:42:25,712
The real question is,
why aren't you following me back?

595
00:42:25,837 --> 00:42:28,006
Why would I do that?

596
00:42:33,910 --> 00:42:35,226
Why are you laughing?

597
00:42:54,016 --> 00:42:55,585
You're too close.

598
00:43:01,206 --> 00:43:03,375
So, how close can we get, Kierra?

599
00:43:04,918 --> 00:43:06,586
What should be our limit?

600
00:43:07,379 --> 00:43:08,632
You tell me.

601
00:43:13,969 --> 00:43:15,483
Should there be a limit?

602
00:43:16,221 --> 00:43:17,436
Crazy idea.

603
00:43:19,291 --> 00:43:21,460
I want to get to know you more.

604
00:44:05,312 --> 00:44:06,563
I don't know.

605
00:44:07,105 --> 00:44:10,025
I just feel so unsatisfied
these past few nights, bro.

606
00:44:11,234 --> 00:44:12,194
You?

607
00:44:12,652 --> 00:44:15,739
Unsatisfied with one-night stands?

608
00:44:17,621 --> 00:44:21,875
Maybe I'm getting too old
for this kind of lifestyle.

609
00:44:22,329 --> 00:44:25,791
Or maybe you're starting
to like someone?

610
00:44:27,042 --> 00:44:28,084
Maybe…

611
00:44:28,543 --> 00:44:32,005
Maybe your mind knows
that you like that one girl.

612
00:44:32,380 --> 00:44:34,794
One girl. And maybe—

613
00:44:35,342 --> 00:44:39,427
your body starts rejecting sleeping
around with some other girl.

614
00:44:40,388 --> 00:44:46,186
I think you want to settle down with one
girl or commit yourself to one girl.

615
00:44:46,728 --> 00:44:47,771
Commit?

616
00:44:47,796 --> 00:44:50,872
You know I'm not the kind of guy
who commits, right?

617
00:44:53,464 --> 00:44:54,173
See?

618
00:44:54,461 --> 00:44:56,546
Your body is already rejecting
what you're saying.

619
00:44:56,720 --> 00:44:57,805
Come on.

620
00:44:59,241 --> 00:45:02,744
Okay, Shan. So it’s about the girl
who gave you four thousand, right?

621
00:45:03,578 --> 00:45:05,247
You’ve been hanging out with her.

622
00:45:05,705 --> 00:45:06,581
Yeah.

623
00:45:06,957 --> 00:45:08,667
But she has nothing to do with this.

624
00:45:08,834 --> 00:45:10,460
Not everything is about her.

625
00:45:10,669 --> 00:45:12,170
Oh, come on, Shan,

626
00:45:12,170 --> 00:45:14,172
everything is all about her.

627
00:45:17,590 --> 00:45:20,529
Okay, fine. It's already 2AM here.

628
00:45:20,577 --> 00:45:21,786
I'll just call you again, okay?

629
00:45:22,055 --> 00:45:23,114
Okay.

630
00:45:23,471 --> 00:45:24,805
Just call me anytime.

631
00:45:25,475 --> 00:45:26,601
Bye.

632
00:45:27,435 --> 00:45:28,353
Take care.

633
00:45:40,991 --> 00:45:42,325
Name for the drinks?

634
00:45:43,076 --> 00:45:44,369
Kierra…

635
00:45:45,370 --> 00:45:46,913
and Theo.

636
00:46:20,113 --> 00:46:20,986
Nice feed.

637
00:46:22,414 --> 00:46:23,572
This is very her.

638
00:46:40,548 --> 00:46:42,064
What happened to your smile?

639
00:46:45,805 --> 00:46:47,474
Hello, Ma’am Kierra.
Welcome back.

640
00:46:47,474 --> 00:46:50,908
Where’s the other barista, Shan?
I just have something to ask.

641
00:46:50,933 --> 00:46:53,352
Oh, he's not here.
He’s not on shift today.

642
00:46:53,664 --> 00:46:55,229
Ah, I see.

643
00:46:55,899 --> 00:46:58,985
You better be careful if you don't want
your heart broken.

644
00:46:58,985 --> 00:46:59,861
Why?

645
00:47:00,403 --> 00:47:01,905
Is he really a red flag?

646
00:47:01,905 --> 00:47:04,824
All I know is he's a walking heartbreak

647
00:47:04,824 --> 00:47:07,452
but there's no chance
of commitment with him.

648
00:47:07,452 --> 00:47:10,163
You know, Ke,
don't think about us too much.

649
00:47:10,163 --> 00:47:11,873
We're fine, right?

650
00:47:11,873 --> 00:47:13,959
You wish I actually thought of you.

651
00:47:15,915 --> 00:47:17,417
How will you get home?

652
00:47:18,713 --> 00:47:20,830
Come on, I'll take you home.

653
00:47:20,855 --> 00:47:23,066
Is this how you invite your FWBs?

654
00:47:23,218 --> 00:47:27,597
For the record, this is the first time
and you're the first girl

655
00:47:27,597 --> 00:47:29,307
I've invited to my unit.

656
00:47:29,408 --> 00:47:33,658
But okay, if you wanna come home to my
place, I mean, I'm still down for that.

657
00:47:33,937 --> 00:47:35,146
It looks good on you.

658
00:47:35,897 --> 00:47:36,940
Do you have a crush on me?

659
00:47:37,732 --> 00:47:38,942
Is it that obvious?
